+"""Exp 4922 distributional-energy verifier pivot scaffold.
+
+Spec refs: REQ-KONA-4922, SCENARIO-KONA-4922-DRY-RUN,
+SCENARIO-KONA-4922-BLOCKED, SCENARIO-KONA-4922-NO-WIN-CLAIM.
